# CMS Integration (Future)

## Abstraction
All content via service interfaces in `src/services/content/`:
```ts
interface ContentService {
  getAnnouncements(filters?): Promise<Announcement[]>;
  getNews(slug?): Promise<NewsItem[]>;
  getEvents(filters?): Promise<Event[]>;
  getFaculties(): Promise<Faculty[]>;
  getPage(slug: string): Promise<Page>;
}
```

## Adapters
- `MockContentService` — current (mock data)
- `StrapiContentService` / `SanityContentService` — future

## Rules
- Components import `getContentService()` factory, never CMS SDK
- Map CMS shapes to domain types in adapter layer
- Support preview/draft mode via `?preview=true` (future)
- Cache with revalidation tags per content type

## Types
Domain types in `src/types/content.ts` — CMS-agnostic field names.
